'' The translation of tests/c2t/src/glinc.h compiles, for each target in TARGETS.
'' TEST: cli
'' HOSTS: windows
''     (its c2t step imports for x86_64-pc-windows-msvc, whatever the target: the Windows SDK's windows.h)
